Origin: DHI-internal (DHI build harness)
Description: Let the build supply GIT_SHA and LINKERD2_PROXY_BUILD_DATE through <NAME>_OVERRIDE
 variables. The source tree has no .git and `date -u` embeds the wall clock, so without this the
 release banner shows an empty commit and a different date on every build.
